# Keep the design artboards out of GitHub's language statistics.
#
# design/restage-product-design.html is 2.5 MB — a published canvas with its
# images embedded — and the seven .dc.html artboards add another 100 KB. Against
# roughly 890 KB of TypeScript, that made the repository read as ~74% HTML on
# the GitHub landing page, which is a fair summary of the byte count and a
# misleading one about the project.
#
# `linguist-documentation` rather than `linguist-vendored`: this is our own
# design documentation, not third-party code we happen to carry.
design/** linguist-documentation

# Same reasoning for the demo media the design references.
design/**/*.mp4 binary
design/**/*.jpg binary
